&lt;p&gt;运行文明5比较容易，只需要设置启动选项为:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>我在公司的服务器上执行了sudo rm -rf /*</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2018-11-24-when-i-execute-sudo-rm-rf-on-the-company-server/</link><pubDate>Sat, 24 Nov 2018 08:31:19 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E7%94%9F%E6%B4%BB/2018-11-24-when-i-execute-sudo-rm-rf-on-the-company-server/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;TL;DR&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt; * 依靠人的小心谨慎是不靠谱的，人总有失误的时候
 * 看了下docker volume的权限机制，貌似是从docker image中继承。
 * 写了两个脚本，用来把rm alias到mv，避免手滑
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;又是一个&lt;del&gt;可以摸鱼的&lt;/del&gt;周五晚上，sensespider系统测试了一天，fix了几个Bug,似乎可以发布了。系统一直是部署在了docker中..这几天测试产生了不少结果文件在host的volume中&amp;hellip; 看着不舒服，干脆删一下好了&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>20170819近况</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-08-20-20170819/</link><pubDate>Sun, 20 Aug 2017 08:56:15 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-08-20-20170819/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;一转眼&amp;hellip;暑假就要结束了&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;秋招似乎也可以告一段落了&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>..........呜呜呜</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-31-e5919ce5919ce5919c/</link><pubDate>Fri, 31 Mar 2017 07:45:10 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-31-e5919ce5919ce5919c/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;&amp;hellip;.拿到offer结果被人同情得问&amp;hellip;&amp;ldquo;你怎么这么惨&amp;rdquo;&amp;hellip;还不止被一个人这样说&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>预言向：大概还是要再打一年的</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-11-e9a284e8a880e59091efbc9ae5a4a7e6a682e8bf98e698afe8a681e5868de68993e4b880e5b9b4e79a84/</link><pubDate>Sat, 11 Mar 2017 19:36:57 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-03-11-e9a284e8a880e59091efbc9ae5a4a7e6a682e8bf98e698afe8a681e5868de68993e4b880e5b9b4e79a84/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;虽然说感觉这届学弟蛮厉害&amp;hellip;不知道能不能拿到校内资格。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>hypereal面小记</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/2017-02-17-hypereal-inern-interview/</link><pubDate>Fri, 17 Feb 2017 08:44:43 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/2017-02-17-hypereal-inern-interview/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;第一次参加面试orz&amp;hellip;所以还是有点期待+紧张的2333&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>再见2016</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-27-e5868de8a7812016/</link><pubDate>Fri, 27 Jan 2017 13:22:24 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-27-e5868de8a7812016/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;所以还是稍微写写年终总结吧..&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;感觉&amp;hellip;2016分成了两部分吧，前11个月是一部分，后1个月是另一部分。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>又是这种绝望的感觉...</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e58f88e698afe8bf99e7a78de7bb9de69c9be79a84e6849fe8a789/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Jan 2017 13:02:56 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e58f88e698afe8bf99e7a78de7bb9de69c9be79a84e6849fe8a789/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;绝望什么的&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;总要有个具体的事情吧&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;可是又说不清&amp;hellip;好像突然每件事都让我绝望&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>大概功课不忙才有资本谈恋爱吧2333</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e5a4a7e6a682e58a9fe8afbee4b88de5bf99e6898de69c89e8b584e69cace8b088e6818be788b1e590a72333/</link><pubDate>Sat, 07 Jan 2017 06:18:04 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-07-e5a4a7e6a682e58a9fe8afbee4b88de5bf99e6898de69c89e8b584e69cace8b088e6818be788b1e590a72333/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;“元旦打算干嘛？”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;“复习啊，你微机接口复习好了？数据库复习好了？体系架构复习好了？编译原理复习好了？嵌入式复习好了？”&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>其实每个时代都有不同的诱惑</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-06-e585b6e5ae9ee6af8fe4b8aae697b6e4bba3e983bde69c89e4b88de5908ce79a84e8afb1e68391/</link><pubDate>Fri, 06 Jan 2017 10:45:55 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2017/2017-01-06-e585b6e5ae9ee6af8fe4b8aae697b6e4bba3e983bde69c89e4b88de5908ce79a84e8afb1e68391/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;人生大概就是同各种欲望，各种诱惑做斗争的过程吧。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>20161217。。。</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-12-17-20161217e38082e38082e38082/</link><pubDate>Sat, 17 Dec 2016 10:21:32 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-12-17-20161217e38082e38082e38082/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;不知道什么时候会死。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;中弹。。。是谁。。。。？&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;竟然是。。。小学的一个同学。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>承认吧，我就是不喜欢和人在一起</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-12-02-e689bfe8aea4e590a7efbc8ce68891e5b0b1e698afe4b88de5969ce6aca2e5928ce4babae59ca8e4b880e8b5b7/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 Dec 2016 03:37:49 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-12-02-e689bfe8aea4e590a7efbc8ce68891e5b0b1e698afe4b88de5969ce6aca2e5928ce4babae59ca8e4b880e8b5b7/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;原因大概是觉得&amp;hellip;我好无趣啊&amp;hellip;你也好无趣啊&amp;hellip;.何必浪费口舌在这里客套呢&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>反思</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-19-e58f8de6809d/</link><pubDate>Sat, 19 Nov 2016 10:59:39 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-19-e58f8de6809d/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;我的问题。。。大概在于。。。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;太容易中途弃疗。。以及。。。没有成为队伍carry的觉悟。。。或者说信心。。。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>。。。。。。。。</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-17-e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082/</link><pubDate>Thu, 17 Nov 2016 16:04:28 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-17-e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082e38082/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;这样下去迟早抑郁&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>对deepin失望至极</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-14-e5afb9deepine5a4b1e69c9be887b3e69e81/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Nov 2016 16:08:21 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-14-e5afb9deepine5a4b1e69c9be887b3e69e81/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;前几天忘记什么原因，把gnome的什么东西搞坏了，干脆就换了kde.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>辣鸡kde</title><link>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-14-e8bea3e9b8a1kde/</link><pubDate>Mon, 14 Nov 2016 03:02:41 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://111qqz.com/en/post/acm-icpc/2016/2016-11-14-e8bea3e9b8a1kde/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;kde好难用啊&amp;hellip;.&lt;/p&gt;
